# Wave T25 (Meadowbrook register): the Balance Scales — the
# gym's crown, mounted on the roof centre where the painting
# and the town's own sign put them ("the gym keeps the same
# hours as the ponds: always"). A brass balance: finial knob,
# beam, two chain-hung pans, centre post and splay feet.
# FULLY OPAQUE by design: it composites over the gym door
# arch, whose ground family is 'path' — the sage stone of the
# roof it crowns is baked in, never transparency.
# (WAVE-T25-MEADOWBROOK-PLAN.md, Prop register.)
